{"id":14,"date":"2019-01-31T11:03:34","date_gmt":"2019-01-31T11:03:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/?page_id=14"},"modified":"2020-11-09T12:48:24","modified_gmt":"2020-11-09T12:48:24","slug":"case-studies","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/case-studies\/","title":{"rendered":"Case Studies"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542919030{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542787173{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542891988{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;]  <!-- start here -->\n   <div class=\"case-study-sec\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n                  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\">\n        <div class=\"case-study-post\">\n          <div class=\"img-box\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/2018-09-07-12.51.08-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"text-box\">\n            <h3 class=\"service-title case-title\">Project Management of a new Dual MRI Facility at Walsall Manor Hospital \u2013 InHealth Group<\/h3>\n            <p>We worked for and on behalf of InHealth Group, to Project Manage the design and build of a new dual MRI scanning Department at Walsall Manor Hospital. This project ran for eighteen months in duration and the turnkey build contract was substantial.<\/p>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/case-study\/project-management-of-a-new-dual-mri-facility-at-walsall-manor-hospital-inhealth-group\/\" tabindex=\"0\">READ MORE<\/a>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n              <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\">\n        <div class=\"case-study-post\">\n          <div class=\"img-box\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/IMG_4058-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"text-box\">\n            <h3 class=\"service-title case-title\">My Vet \u2013 CT Project Management and CT installation in Dublin<\/h3>\n            <p>We were proud to work for and on behalf of LBN Medical to install a refurbished Aquilion RXL into a new veterinary practice called MyVet. MyVet are based in Lucan on the outskirts of Dublin in the Republic of Ireland.<\/p>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/case-study\/my-vet-ct-project-management-and-ct-installation-in-dublin\/\" tabindex=\"0\">READ MORE<\/a>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n              <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\">\n        <div class=\"case-study-post\">\n          <div class=\"img-box\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/IMG_0040-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"text-box\">\n            <h3 class=\"service-title case-title\">Canon Medical Systems UK\u2013 Royal Berkshire Hospital \u2013 Prime SP Bence Built Relocatable<\/h3>\n            <p>Very proud to work for Canon and closely with WH Bence to project manage this very high specification relocatable.This unit was designed and built in record time. The entire project ran on time and on budget due to the focussed and diligent work of all the project stakeholders.<\/p>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/case-study\/canon-medical-systems-uk-royal-berkshire-hospital-prime-sp-bence-built-relocatable\/\" tabindex=\"0\">READ MORE<\/a>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n              <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6\">\n        <div class=\"case-study-post\">\n          <div class=\"img-box\">\n            <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/4754022E-DE24-41E6-A0DD-42EC370F92D0-2-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          <\/div>\n          <div class=\"text-box\">\n            <h3 class=\"service-title case-title\">Agito Medical \u2013 Nuffield  Hospital, Glasgow \u2013 Siemens Avanto 1.5T Deinstallation and Removal<\/h3>\n            <p>We turned this project around with very short notice and ensured that we were well prepared. This resulted in a smooth and timely execution of this project. Both Agito and the centre manager at Nuffield Glasgow, were delighted with how the project ran and by now, they will be up and running with their new Siemens MRI.<\/p>\n            <a class=\"btn btn-default\" href=\"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/case-study\/agito-medical-nuffield-hospital-glasgow-siemens-avanto-1-5t-qa-and-removal\/\" tabindex=\"0\">READ MORE<\/a>\n          <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n       \n  <\/div>\n<\/div>  <!-- end here -->\n  [\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542919030{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 70px !important;padding-bottom: 70px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542787173{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1549542891988{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;border-top-width: 0px !important;border-bottom-width: 0px !important;padding-top: 0px !important;padding-bottom: 0px !important;}&#8221;][\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":60,"parent":0,"menu_order":5,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-14","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=14"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":646,"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14\/revisions\/646"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/60"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/goringmedicalprojects.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=14"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}